#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
