#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
