msgstr "每个科学家都会欣赏一个好的玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
