msgstr "这个看起来像制作皮弗娄牛礼服的指南！可惜只有一件……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "It's pretty hard to teach a beefalo \"sit\" and \"stay\"."
msgstr "想教会皮弗娄牛“坐下”和“别动”真的很难。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "This looks easy enough to put together."
msgstr "看起来很容易组装。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "My mom has one of those! It looks a bit different, though."
msgstr "我妈妈也有一个！不过看起来有点不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "Now to put it together!"
msgstr "现在来把它装好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "Let's win some prizes, Woby!"
msgstr "我们来争夺奖项吧，沃比！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "It can't be that much harder than pitching a tent."
msgstr "应该不会比搭帐篷难很多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies..."
msgstr "真是浪费物资……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think I need to offer it something for it to work."
msgstr "我想我需要给它一些东西才行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we get, Woby?"
msgstr "我们应该拿什么，沃比？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Hey! I was going to use that!"
msgstr "嘿！我正打算用那个呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "A good sense of direction is important for survival!"
msgstr "良好的方向感对生存很重要！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "You'll never be a Pinetree Pioneer if you can't follow directions!"
msgstr "如果不会听从指令就不能成为一名合格的松树先锋队员！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better start training my Carrat."
msgstr "我最好早点开始训练我的胡萝卜鼠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "I... reacted too slow... to put the fire out..."
msgstr "我……反应太慢……没能及时灭火……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "By the time we're done, my Carrat will be ready for anything!"
msgstr "等完成后，我的胡萝卜鼠就可以胜任一切了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "These reflexes could save your life in the wilderness!"
msgstr "这些反应能力可以在野外救你一命！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "Maybe I'll put it over here... no, over there!"
msgstr "把它放在这……不对，往那边移一点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "Does that look like a fire pit?!"
msgstr "那个看起来像不像营火？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never been a coach before!"
msgstr "我从来没有当过教练！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Hustle, hustle! Coaches say that, right?"
msgstr "快点，快点！教练都这么说，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "Do you think we should put it over there, Woby?"
msgstr "你觉得我们应该把它放在那边吗，沃比？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no!!"
msgstr "哦不！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "This is very serious training equipment."
msgstr "这是非常严肃的训练设备。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Aww look at him jump!"
msgstr "啊，看他跳的样子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "I'm great at putting things together!"
msgstr "我很擅长组装东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A good race needs some planning."
msgstr "一场好的比赛需要一些规划。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "Should it go there... no, no, maybe over there..."
msgstr "把它放在这……不对，往那边移一点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Someone sabotaged the race!"
msgstr "有人破坏了赛场！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "First one here wins!"
msgstr "第一名将会胜出！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Yes!! Good job little guy!"
msgstr "干得漂亮，小家伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "We'll be back for a rematch, {winner}!"
msgstr "我们还会回来再比赛的，{winner}！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "What if the race just went on forever?"
msgstr "如果比赛就这样一直进行下去会怎么样？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Let's start this race!"
msgstr "开始比赛吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "Woby, help me look for a good place to set this up!"
msgstr "沃比，帮我找一个好的地方把这东西装起来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Why won't everyone just use the fire pit?!"
msgstr "为什么大家都不愿意用营火呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "He just needs some more training. We'll get there!"
msgstr "他只是需要一些更多的训练。我们会成功的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "Woah, all our training paid off!"
msgstr "哇，我们所有的训练都得到了回报！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "Do I get a badge for having the best Carrat?"
msgstr "有没有最佳胡萝卜鼠的奖章？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "I never knew skills could be measured by weight."
msgstr "我从来不知道技能可以用重量来衡量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Mystery seeds!"
msgstr "神秘的种子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "Not knowing what they are is half the fun!"
msgstr "一半的乐趣就来源于不知道它们是什么！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "We'll have his head on a platter!"
msgstr "我们会把他的头放在盘子里！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Well, at least the worms are enjoying it."
msgstr "好吧，至少虫子们很喜欢它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Who ate all the good parts?"
msgstr "谁把好的部分都吃了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "That sure is a mystery!"
msgstr "这确实是个谜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "I think I'm doing a good job!"
msgstr "我觉得我做得很棒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something must be bothering it."
msgstr "一定有什么东西在困扰着它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "Maybe it would be happier if it wasn't all alone?"
msgstr "给它找个伴，它会更开心吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "I think it needs a story or two to cheer it up!"
msgstr "我想它需要一两个故事来振作!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "I should probably do some weeding."
msgstr "也许我该除除草了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "Do you think it needs some water, Woby?"
msgstr "你觉得它需要浇水吗，沃比？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "Maybe it needs some better soil..."
msgstr "也许它需要更好的土壤……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "I think we might've planted these too close together, Woby."
msgstr "我们种的太密了，沃比。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "I don't think it likes this weather."
msgstr "我觉得它并不喜欢这个气候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "It's not looking so good..."
msgstr "看起来不太好啊……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Hurry, stomp it out before it catches fire!"
msgstr "快点，在它着火之前把它踩灭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I sure wish I had a flashlight."
msgstr "我真希望有一个手电筒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "If I'm the first one they see, they might think I'm their mom."
msgstr "如果我是它们第一个看到的人，它们可能会认为我是他们的妈妈。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Mmmm, tastes like a perfectly toasted s'more."
msgstr "嗯，味道就像一个完美的烤棉花糖夹心饼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "Oh well, we can just try again right? Right...?"
msgstr "哦，我们可以再试一次，对吗？对不对……？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Darnit! It's uh... a bit crispy..."
msgstr "糟糕！它呃……有点脆……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Huh. I thought that would go alright together."
msgstr "哈。我还以为这些可以放在一起呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "Aw, do we really have to leave?"
msgstr "啊，我们真的要离开吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I'll need a key to get through."
msgstr "我要有钥匙才能通过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "Un moment, the judge seems to be occupied."
msgstr "等一等，裁判好像在忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I would seriously hurt myself if I did."
msgstr "我要是照做就会受重伤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "That would be wasteful."
msgstr "那样会浪费。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "No need, it's already en glace."
msgstr "不需要，已经是在冰里了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I already have a little companion."
msgstr "我已经有小伙伴了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "Mon dieu, that's far away."
msgstr "我的天啊，实在是太远了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "It, oh, it appears to be on fire."
msgstr "它，哦，它似乎着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess it never occurred to me I'd need to change."
msgstr "我从来不觉得我需要换衣服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "I should give them their privacy."
msgstr "我该给他们一点隐私。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I'll be needing something to groom, non?"
msgstr "得有东西来让我打扮，不是吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "There's not really much to work with at the moment."
msgstr "就这点的话，我实在无从下手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "Ah non, this fish is far too small."
msgstr "噢不，这条简直太小了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "I'm afraid it's a bit too small."
msgstr "恐怕有些太小了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I'm missing some ingredients."
msgstr "缺少一些原料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi! Someone's already doing that."
msgstr "抱歉！有人已经在做了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "I think I've gotten something mixed up."
msgstr "可能有地方出错了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "This isn't the best place for it."
msgstr "这里不是最佳地点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not quite ready yet."
msgstr "我还没准备好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi! I shouldn't backseat cook."
msgstr "抱歉！我不应该对别人的厨艺指手画脚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I'll need to get a little closer to cook with that."
msgstr "我需要靠近一点才能用那个烹饪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "Just a little longer... It's almost done."
msgstr "再等等,马上就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Oh, excusez-moi."
msgstr "噢，抱歉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "Oops, I've left some ingredients inside."
msgstr "哎呀，里面还有原料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "What should I draw?"
msgstr "我应该画一些什么呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "Mais non, this salt water will not do!"
msgstr "不妥，用盐水是不行的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Ah non, the fish are too deep for my rod to reach."
msgstr "啊不，鱼太深，我的鱼竿够不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "Apologies, ma petite choux-fleur."
msgstr "抱歉，我的小菜花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi, they seem busy right now."
msgstr "抱歉，他们好像挺忙的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be working."
msgstr "它看起来好像坏了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "噢，不好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We've learned that already."
msgstr "已经学过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "Let them enjoy their meal first."
msgstr "让他们先吃已经有的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Non."
msgstr "不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "I don't think they would appreciate it."
msgstr "他们不会喜欢的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "It needs a dash of something else."
msgstr "需要一点其他东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "It needs a dash of something else."
msgstr "需要一点其他东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "They don't seem to take well to planting."
msgstr "它们好像不太愿意被种。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "I imagine I'll need to see the moon for this."
msgstr "我想得看到月亮才行吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY"
msgid "It's not quite right."
msgstr "不太对啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "It would tarnish my reputation to serve that."
msgstr "我要是给别人上这个，名声可就毁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "Hmm... Non."
msgstr "嗯,不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "That doesn't seem right."
msgstr "那似乎不对。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "I need something long and thin, like a wooden spoon."
msgstr "我需要细长的东西，像木勺子一样的形状。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "It wouldn't be safe right now."
msgstr "现在这么做，有点不安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "We should sort out this mess first."
msgstr "我们应该先收拾好地上的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "It's a bit late in the evening for that."
msgstr "有点太晚了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "它在睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "I'd have to take the other object out first."
msgstr "我得先把另一件东西先拿出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "It wants a different gem."
msgstr "它想要一颗不同的宝石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "It looks a little funny, doesn't it?"
msgstr "看着挺好玩的，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "They've got other pans in the fire."
msgstr "他们各自在忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "Sadly it won't do them much good."
msgstr "可惜帮不到他们了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "Fuller than a belly at a six course meal."
msgstr "比吃完满汉全席的肚子都满。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They're snoozing right now."
msgstr "他们正打盹呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "They've got other pans in the fire."
msgstr "他们各自在忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "Sadly it won't do them much good."
msgstr "可惜帮不到他们了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "Fuller than a belly at a six course meal."
msgstr "比吃完满汉全席的肚子都满。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They're snoozing right now."
msgstr "他们正打盹呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We've learned that already."
msgstr "已经学过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED"
msgid "Already done, mon ami."
msgstr "已经做了，我的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD"
msgid "Perhaps when it's not in such a foul mood."
msgstr "等它的心情没那么糟糕的时候再试试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF"
msgid "I don't have anything to hitch to it."
msgstr "我无牛可拴。"

