msgstr "我们打死也不要吃那玩意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING"
