msgstr "哎哟！我们再试试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY"
