#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7"
msgid "We think those might belong to someone else."
msgstr "我们觉得这些应该是其他人的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "So shiny!"
msgstr "好闪亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "If we talk to it will it talk back?"
msgstr "我们和它聊天，它会回话吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "Weird little plant."
msgstr "奇怪的小植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "What a colorful plant."
msgstr "真是一株颜色美丽的植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "I wish we could learn to generate meat."
msgstr "真希望我们能够学会如何生产肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "It looks weird... but tastes great!"
msgstr "看起来奇怪……但是很好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "Wow. Look at it bubble."
msgstr "哇。瞧这泡泡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Woah! That's a big bird!"
msgstr "哇！那是一只大鸟！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "It could've eaten us in one bite!"
msgstr "它可以一口就吃掉我们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "Tickly!"
msgstr "挠痒痒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "We used our nicest spider silk!"
msgstr "我们用了我们最好的蛛丝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He doesn't look like he's having much fun."
msgstr "他看起来不怎么开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "The skin is all seared."
msgstr "表皮全部烧焦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "We fall asleep in the bath too!"
msgstr "我们也会在浴缸里睡着！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "You're a bad friend!"
msgstr "你是一个坏朋友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "The meeping had to stop."
msgstr "嚎叫终于停止了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "That's a funny looking plant."
msgstr "这种植物的外形真有趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "We feel lucky, oh so lucky."
msgstr "我们觉得很幸运，实在是太幸运了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "There's nothing on it."
msgstr "上面没有任何东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "Maybe we should take up sculpting."
msgstr "也许我们该练练雕刻了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "Bean there, done that!"
msgstr "曾经在那里，已经采过了!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "You can plant anything in the ground!"
msgstr "你可以在土地上种植任何东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "Nothing lasts forever on its own."
msgstr "任何东西本身无法永久持续。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "That's a weird shape for a bush."
msgstr "那形状对灌木来说很奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "I hope it doesn't fall on us."
msgstr "希望不会砸到我们。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It will be gone soon!"
msgstr "很快它就会化为灰烬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "Extra crispy!"
msgstr "嘎嘣脆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Hope we don't fall on that."
msgstr "希望我们别掉在上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "That hurt our hands."
msgstr "扎到手了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "That's a thirsty plant."
msgstr "那是一株很口渴的植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's extra dangerous now!"
msgstr "现在尤其危险！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Its growing days are over."
msgstr "它生长的日子结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Axes can solve all tree-related problems!"
msgstr "斧子可以解决掉所有与树有关的问题！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A harsh tree for harsh conditions."
msgstr "严酷环境下生长的浑身是刺的树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES"
