#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1"
msgid "It tells us how to make a beefalo costume. Well, part of one..."
msgstr "它能教我们怎么做皮弗娄牛礼服。应该说是，礼服的一部分……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2"
