msgstr "很肥的蜜蜂，不过它的刺看起来很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
