msgstr "但我想要更多的浆果！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
