msgstr "一些种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "He doesn't look too happy..."
msgstr "他看起来不太开心……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
