msgstr "有了火，一切都变好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "Definitely not a bird."
msgstr "绝对不是鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "Using fire on it made it a tastier eggplant."
msgstr "火让茄子变得更美味了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with all this eggplant?!"
msgstr "我拿这么多茄子做什么？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "Some seeds."
msgstr "一些种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Alright, alright, so I was wrong about the hand!"
msgstr "好吧，好吧，在手这方面是我错了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I'm telling you, there's a monsterhand under that thing!"
msgstr "我是告诉你，那东西下面有一只怪物的手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Not as good as a fire, but at least we won't be in the dark."
msgstr "不像火焰那么好，但至少我们不会处于黑暗中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a bunch of dumb flowers."
msgstr "只是一束愚蠢的花朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "We're gonna be in the dark soon."
msgstr "我们很快就要处于黑暗之中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "Those need replacing."
msgstr "那些需要替换。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "就是这样！烧吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "真希望火还没灭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "One less tree in the world."
msgstr "世上又少了一棵树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like it would burn well."
msgstr "看起来它会烧得很旺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "就是这样！烧吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "真希望火还没灭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "One less tree in the world."
msgstr "世上又少了一棵树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Die in a fire!"
msgstr "在火中结束吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "Keeps the rain out your eyes and in someone else's."
msgstr "不要让自己和别人流眼泪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "They spread like fire."
msgstr "它们像火一样迅速扩散。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "I wish it lit stuff on fire."
msgstr "我希望它能让东西点燃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "It's no good until it's been placed."
msgstr "它安置妥当后才有好处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "It was a nice finale."
msgstr "这是个不错的结局。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sigh. It's a pile of dirt."
msgstr "唉，这是一堆土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Hurry up, dirtpile. Feed me!"
msgstr "加把劲，土堆。给我提供食物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "Stupid thing needs poop."
msgstr "蠢东西又需要施肥了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Farming is so much work..."
msgstr "种地好辛苦……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "Heh heh."
msgstr "呵呵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Took long enough."
msgstr "总算啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Well that looks kind of unnatural."
msgstr "看起来有些违背自然规律。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Wait, what kind of vegetable is that supposed to be?"
msgstr "那是怎么蔬菜？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "A dumb plant."
msgstr "笨植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "Grow faster already!"
msgstr "给我快点长！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "Yeah... I'm not eating that."
msgstr "谁都别指望我吃那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A big pile of stinky mush."
msgstr "一大堆的臭土豆泥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "Ugh, this is going to take ages."
msgstr "额，这是要等到猴年马月。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "Yeah, fight that ground!"
msgstr "对，就跟地面干！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "Guess I better find a dumb spot to plant some dumb plants."
msgstr "找个笨地方种这些笨庄稼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Get outta here!"
msgstr "给我滚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "I dunno... it could put out some fires..."
msgstr "我不知道...它可以灭火..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "A phoenix reborn!"
msgstr "浴火重生！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "So what does the feather do again?"
msgstr "所以羽毛又做了什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Canary feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "金丝雀羽毛。它燃烧起来也许很难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Black bird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "黑鸟的羽毛。烧着了应该很难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Redbird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "红雀羽毛。它燃烧起来也许很难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "Snowbird feather. It probably smells terrible on fire."
msgstr "雪雀羽毛。它燃烧起来也许很难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She looks scared half to death."
msgstr "她看起来已经被吓得半死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "I'm not painting that."
msgstr "我不给那个涂漆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "I guess we could pen stuff in with it."
msgstr "我猜我们可以用它把东西关起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "No point just leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "把它留在地面上没有什么意义。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "No point just leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "把它留在地面上没有什么意义。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket full of nasty."
msgstr "满满的一桶脏东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "It's just so festive!"
msgstr "太有节日气息了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It needs more firecrackers before I'd call it \"festive\"."
msgstr "没有鞭炮，就不叫“喜庆”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "So I just wave it and FIRE APPEARS?"
msgstr "只要我挥一挥它，就会出现火吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Light'em up!"
msgstr "把它们点燃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish they didn't run away!"
msgstr "真希望它们没有跑掉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "They're like little fires in my pocket!"
msgstr "它们就像是装在我口袋里的小火苗！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "I actually kind of like that one."
msgstr "实际上我还挺喜欢那家伙的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "What do you mean it's a weed? Looks like an improvement to me!"
msgstr "什么叫杂草？我怎么看它怎么好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Uh oh. It's almost gone!"
msgstr "啊哦。就快要熄灭了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could watch it for hours."
msgstr "我可以几个小时一直盯着它看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "BURN! BURN FASTER!"
msgstr "烧吧！烧得再旺点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "This fire is small and boring."
msgstr "火太小了，真无聊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Burn!"
msgstr "烧吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "Make the fire come back!"
msgstr "重新把火点燃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "That's my absolute favorite toy."
msgstr "那绝对是我最喜爱的玩具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Almost out."
msgstr "燃料就快用完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "And stay off!"
msgstr "就保持这样！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "I wish you'd shut your lid and stop putting out fires."
msgstr "真希望你赶紧关上盖子，不要再把火扑灭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Slippery fishy!"
msgstr "滑不溜秋的鱼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "I love throwing things to catch other things!"
msgstr "我喜欢丢东西出去抓东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "Fishing for the answer with a hook, line and sinker."
msgstr "用鱼钩、钓鱼线和坠子来钓鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "Needs fire!"
msgstr "需要火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Less slippery now that it's found fire."
msgstr "烤过之后的鱼没之前那么滑溜溜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "I like sushi, but I prefer it flame-broiled."
msgstr "我喜欢生鱼片，但我更喜欢用火烤过的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "Fish and fire go well together."
msgstr "鱼和火是绝配。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "What you see is what you get. Sticks of fish."
msgstr "所见即所得。瞧，炸鱼排。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Convenient taco-grip."
msgstr "真是方便好拿的鱼肉玉米卷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "Did we just... put a hole in the boat?"
msgstr "我们把船凿出了个洞吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Less slippery now that it's found fire."
msgstr "烤过之后的鱼没之前那么滑溜溜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "The poor man's fire-starter."
msgstr "可怜人的打火石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't have time to waste on flowers."
msgstr "我可没有时间浪费在花朵上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "I'd like to burn this flower in particular."
msgstr "我特别想烧掉这朵花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "A halo of flowers. Too bad it's not a burning halo of flowers."
msgstr "花环。可惜不是正在燃烧的花环。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "I'd rather a bowl of flames."
msgstr "我宁愿是一碗火苗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "It's burning inside."
msgstr "它里面在燃烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "Ugh, that smells terrible."
msgstr "呃，太难闻了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "Looks like good kindling."
msgstr "看起来点火不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Fuel for the fire."
msgstr "不错的燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Sports are hard."
msgstr "运动可不是那么容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "Some more dumb flowers."
msgstr "几朵笨花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Ugh, it looks so stuffy and proper."
msgstr "额，看起来好正式啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "It's just nasty old bits of bones!"
msgstr "它只是肮脏的老骨头碎片！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "Looks passable."
msgstr "看起来还过得去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "That looks absolutely ridiculous."
msgstr "那看起来荒唐透顶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Needs more gross old bits."
msgstr "需要更多老碎片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Ooo la la."
msgstr "噢啦啦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "Hey, this one's actually helping!"
msgstr "哟，这家伙居然帮我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Showed him!"
msgstr "给他看看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "He's too damp to burn."
msgstr "他太潮湿了，烧不起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "They're cute when they're sleeping."
msgstr "他们睡着的时候好可爱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "Woah, that's a ton of frogs."
msgstr "哇，这大概有一吨的青蛙了吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "If you close your eyes it's a little easier to get it down."
msgstr "闭上眼睛，会更容易把它弄下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "It still twitches every now and then. Freaky."
msgstr "它时不时的还在抽搐。太奇怪了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "The fire made it stop twitching. Fire is the best."
msgstr "是火让它停止抽搐的。火最好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "They're pretty cute."
msgstr "它们很可爱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "Mmm... Roast dragonfruit."
msgstr "嗯...烤火龙果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Good night, little guy."
msgstr "晚安，小家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Get lost, you dumb bugs!"
msgstr "滚开吧，你们这些笨虫子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "Now I'm the the one giving the orders! To Fruit Flies, but still."
msgstr "现在轮到我发号施令了！虽然是些果蝇，但好过没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "Yum, fruit!"
msgstr "好吃的水果！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Black and white and fuzzy all over!"
msgstr "黑白色的毛皮，上面全是毛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Lookit this big dumb lawn ornament!"
msgstr "看看这个又大又蠢的草坪装饰品！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "At least it doesn't smell anymore."
msgstr "至少它不再发臭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "It's just a couple cloves of garlic."
msgstr "只是几头大蒜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Fire made it better."
msgstr "火让它变得更美妙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I bet my breath would smell great if I ate the whole thing."
msgstr "我打赌要是我全吃下去了，我的嘴巴一定很好闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "这只是一把种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "I prefer hot food."
msgstr "我更喜欢吃辣的食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "These must make them move."
msgstr "这些会让它们动起来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "It's so empty!"
msgstr "上面是空的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "I wonder how they hover?"
msgstr "它们究竟是如何浮在空中的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "It feels like they're speaking inside my head!"
msgstr "感觉他们在我脑袋里讲话！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "They sure hate those shadow creeps."
msgstr "他们肯定讨厌那些影子爬行者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "You can't kill what's already dead."
msgstr "你没法杀死一个本来就已经死了的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "Great. Another spooky flower."
msgstr "好极了。有一朵奇怪的花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "Someone should probably check if it's flammable. I volunteer!"
msgstr "该有人检查检查它是不是可燃的。我主动报名！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "It's for me right?!"
msgstr "这是给我的，对吗？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Ribbons burn real good!"
msgstr "缎带烧得真好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "I almost don't want to burn this one."
msgstr "我都有点舍不得烧它了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Hey get back here!"
msgstr "喂！回来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Desserts should not eat people!"
msgstr "甜品不应该吃人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "See? Fire solves everything."
msgstr "看见了吗？一把火解决所有问题。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "Haha, this thing could take an arm off!"
msgstr "哈哈，这个东西可以砍下一条胳膊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "I can't believe that worked!"
msgstr "我不相信这有用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fuzzy! And slimy..."
msgstr "好毛茸茸啊！而且很黏..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Alright, I guess it's kind of cute."
msgstr "好吧，就算有点可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder if it burns..."
msgstr "不知道它可不可以燃烧..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Why does everything have to be a flower?!"
msgstr "为什么不管什么东西身上都长着一朵花？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "It's goopy and weird."
msgstr "又滑又腻，怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "They're so small!"
msgstr "它们太小了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "That's definitely going in my mouth."
msgstr "我要全部吃掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Not so tough without your horn, are you?"
msgstr "没了角就没那么凶了，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "Ha! You look kinda dumb without your horn."
msgstr "哈！你没了角看起来有点笨！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Yeah, that's right! You work for ME now!"
msgstr "对，没错！你现在给我打工了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Geez, look at the nose on that thing!"
msgstr "天啊，看看那东西的鼻子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Ha ha, cool."
msgstr "哈哈，酷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "It's fuzzy with electricity. Yuck."
msgstr "它被电给弄得不纯了。真讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "What a great look!"
msgstr "看起来多棒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "It won't light trees on fire, but at least it's shiny."
msgstr "虽然它没法让树着火，但至少它会闪闪发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "It won't light rocks on fire, but at least it's shiny."
msgstr "虽然它没法让石头着火，但至少它会闪闪发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "It won't light the ground on fire, but at least it's shiny."
msgstr "虽然它没法让地面着火，但至少它会闪闪发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "It won't make flaming pits, but at least it's shiny."
msgstr "虽然它没法用来挖火坑，但至少它会闪闪发光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "It won't help fires grow, but at least it's shiny."
msgstr "虽然不能帮助火苗生长，但至少它闪着光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "What should we spend it on??"
msgstr "我们应该怎么花？？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "So snuggly!"
msgstr "好暖和！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It needs poop."
msgstr "它需要施肥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Fire! Wooo!"
msgstr "烧吧！哇！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "Burn the sick!"
msgstr "烧掉患病的这些！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Blech. You smell."
msgstr "胡说。你闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a flammable tuft of grass."
msgstr "一丛易燃的草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "Grass stubble is kind of useless."
msgstr "草茬没什么用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "Nice, dry, and ready to burn!"
msgstr "好，干燥，正好烧掉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "Double ew!"
msgstr "两个哦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "Ew."
msgstr "哦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "Pretty as can be!"
msgstr "太漂亮了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "Yeah! Pour on the gravy!"
msgstr "对！多倒点肉汁！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "I feel my mind opening when I wear it."
msgstr "戴着它我感觉自己的思维都开阔了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "This one feels really light."
msgstr "这个宝石感觉真的好亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "A big dumb rock."
msgstr "一块又大又愚蠢的岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It won't start a fire but I guess it's still useful."
msgstr "虽然它没法用来生火，但我猜它还是很有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Boring!"
msgstr "真乏味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "It's been transformed by fire!"
msgstr "它通过火完成了变形！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Stupid mushroom."
msgstr "愚蠢的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "Hey! You! Get up here!"
msgstr "喂！你！给我出来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Maybe it will return some day."
msgstr "也许有一天它会再长回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "Ugh, this whole place is damp and gross! I hate it!"
msgstr "呃，这整个地方既潮湿又恶心！我讨厌它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "Ugh, this whole place is damp and gross! I hate it!"
msgstr "呃，这整个地方既潮湿又恶心！我讨厌它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "Holy moley, that's tasty!"
msgstr "天啊，太好吃了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "It burns like normal poop."
msgstr "它烧起来和普通粪便没什么区别。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Oooooooooh! Shiny!"
msgstr "哇哦！好闪亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "That's wayyyy better than a regular apple!"
msgstr "那比一个普通的苹果好多了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "Yesssss! Lollipops!"
msgstr "太棒了！棒棒糖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "I'm gonna need about a dozen of these."
msgstr "我大概需要一打的这些东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Yuck! That's disgusting!"
msgstr "讨厌！真恶心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's sorta tangy."
msgstr "有点重口味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Mmm! It burns my mouth so good!"
msgstr "喔！火辣辣的感觉真好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Do people actually eat these or are they just a bad joke?"
msgstr "人们真的吃这些东西吗或是它们只是不怎么样的笑话？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Ewwww it's corn flavored!"
msgstr "呃呃呃，是玉米口味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Eww! I hate black licorice!"
msgstr "呃！我不喜欢黑色的甘草糖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "These are a meow-uthful."
msgstr "这些是猫叫声。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "Hey Wolfgang, eat one and tell us what it is!"
msgstr "嘿沃尔夫冈，吃一个，然后告诉我们那时什么！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Burn them!!!"
msgstr "烧了它们！！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "Yesssss! Lollipops!"
msgstr "太棒了！棒棒糖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "Why does something so yummy have to look so gross!"
msgstr "为什么这么美味的东西看起来非得这么恶心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "It's like there's a fire in my belly."
msgstr "感觉就像肚子里有一团火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "Ah. The strong stuff."
msgstr "啊。厉害的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "I wish it was a little stronger."
msgstr "我希望它能稍微强一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "I didn't think it was possible to make fire better."
msgstr "我没想到火还能更棒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "Piping hot mutation juice!"
msgstr "火热的变异果汁！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Can I set it on fire?"
msgstr "我能不能放火烧它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "I should decorate for Halloween."
msgstr "我该为万圣节装饰一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "Ugh. I hate those jerks."
msgstr "唉，我讨厌那些混蛋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "Wish it was flammable."
msgstr "真希望它是易燃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "I should hang it somewhere and scare people."
msgstr "我应该把它挂在某个地方吓一吓人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "I'm gonna stick you in a tree."
msgstr "我要把你弄到树上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "Pleased to meat you!"
msgstr "很高兴认识你，我的肉友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "I prefer sharp implements."
msgstr "我喜欢锋利的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "That weapon looks boring."
msgstr "那个武器看起来很没意思。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "I wonder if it'd burn as nicely as actual flowers do."
msgstr "不知道它会不会和真花一样那么易燃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "It burns! But, where's the fire?"
msgstr "它烧着了！但是火在哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I could take a crack at it."
msgstr "我倒可以试试这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's stone cold."
msgstr "已经冷冰冰的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Frozen solid."
msgstr "冰冷刺骨的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire would liven this thing up!"
msgstr "火会让这东西变暖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "Look at how it glows!"
msgstr "看看它是怎么发光的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "No flame, no real heat... what fun is that?"
msgstr "既没有火焰，也没有真正的热量...有什么好玩的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "Heh. I kinda like her."
msgstr "呵，我有点喜欢她。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "I never needed a home, but some people do I guess."
msgstr "我从未需要过家，但也许有人需要它吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a dump."
msgstr "真是个破烂的房子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "Nice, free stuff!"
msgstr "真好，免费的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "Great, more shells I can't burn. Why did I buy these again?"
msgstr "好吧，尽是些我不能烧的贝壳。我当时为什么要买这些？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "Oops..."
msgstr "哎呀……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "Don't worry grams, it's safe with me!"
msgstr "别担心，老奶奶，它在我这很安全！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "That bee's head looks kinda tasty, doesn't it?"
msgstr "蜜蜂的脑袋看起来有些可口，不是吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "I'm gonna burn it."
msgstr "我要烧掉它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Hahaha, yesss!"
msgstr "哈哈哈，没错，就是这样！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Less reading! More burning!"
msgstr "少读！多烧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I should burn something into it."
msgstr "我该在它上面烧出点什么记号。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sweet and delicious!"
msgstr "甜蜜而美味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "It's waxy."
msgstr "像蜡一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Fire, ham and honey go well together."
msgstr "烈火、火腿和蜂蜜是绝配。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Honey-covered morsels that have met my friend, fire."
msgstr "蜂蜜和肉块遇到最可爱的火，就成了蜂蜜包肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "I can hear those hairy beasts inside."
msgstr "我可以听到里面有那些多毛动物的声音。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Now that's my kind of heat!"
msgstr "这才是我要的那种火辣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "The bombs are fun to throw in."
msgstr "扔沐浴球进去会很好玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "What's better than a hotspring? A fire pit!"
msgstr "还有什么能比温泉好？当然是火坑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "So toasty and warm!"
msgstr "暖暖的真舒服！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "Should we smash it up?"
msgstr "我们要不要砸碎它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "What a jerk!"
msgstr "真是个混蛋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "The best way to solve any problem."
msgstr "解决所有问题的最佳办法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "So... now what do we do with it?"
msgstr "现在我拿它怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "BURN ITTTT!"
msgstr "给我烧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Uh oh, I don't like the look of that."
msgstr "啊哦，我不喜欢那东西的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "It's sharp. I like it!"
msgstr "好锋利。我喜欢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "Heh heh. STAY."
msgstr "嘿嘿。待着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "What's your angle?"
msgstr "你在打什么主意？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's too wet to burn."
msgstr "太潮湿了，烧不起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "It's still too wet to burn."
msgstr "这东西太潮，烧不起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Chilly."
msgstr "好冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a lot of ice."
msgstr "好多冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It looks pretty melted."
msgstr "看起来融化了好多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It looks pretty melted."
msgstr "看起来融化了好多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "That is the opposite of fire."
msgstr "这是火的对立面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Well, soooometimes cold things are okay."
msgstr "嗯，有时候冷的东西也挺好的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "It's a real mood dampener."
msgstr "真是个扫兴的家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "Gross! Cold!"
msgstr "可恶！好冷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Fuzzy backpack!"
msgstr "毛茸茸的背包！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Booooring."
msgstr "太太太太无趣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Don't beefalo already have hairy winter coats?"
msgstr "皮弗娄牛不是已经有了御寒的长毛了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "Am I seeing things?"
msgstr "是我看花眼了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Doesn't look flammable. How boring."
msgstr "看上去不像是能燃烧的。太无趣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "Why didn't anyone tell me I had ashes on my face?"
msgstr "怎么没有人告诉我我脸上有灰呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "Wham, bam, jam! Thank you, ma'am."
msgstr "舔，舔，舔！五秒搞定。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "Nothing better than a handful of jellybeans."
msgstr "没有什么比一把彩虹软糖更好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Meat and fire, now with a stick!"
msgstr "火烤的肉，用签子串起！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "HEY! Who dares me to eat it raw?"
msgstr "嘿！谁怂恿我生吃这东西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "Yuck, it feels like snot."
msgstr "呀，感觉跟鼻涕似的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "Great, now I don't have to chew."
msgstr "倒是好，都不用嚼了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "It's not half bad."
msgstr "还不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "I like the cut of that bee's jib."
msgstr "我喜欢那只蜜蜂的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "Buzz!"
msgstr "嗡嗡！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "A lump of coal would be really useful, actually!"
msgstr "事实上，一块煤炭真的会很有用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Ha! I wouldn't wanna get smacked with that thing!"
msgstr "哈！我不会想被那东西掴一掌！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "Nothing says \"Open Me\" quite like a lock!!"
msgstr "没有什么会像锁一样说“把我打开”！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "It's a pony!"
msgstr "是马儿耶！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It looks pretty worn down."
msgstr "它看上去很破旧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "We will be great friends!"
msgstr "我们会成为很好的朋友的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "He sure looks warm..."
msgstr "毫无疑问，他看上去很暖和..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "Stay back, you big jerk!"
msgstr "退后，你这个大混蛋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "The holidays came early this year!"
msgstr "今年提前过圣诞！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "Fire is not meant to be contained like this!"
msgstr "烈火不应该受到这样的束缚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "No skimping on the sour cream!"
msgstr "别舍不得放酸奶油！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Nothing's gonna get through that!"
msgstr "什么都刺不穿那个！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
