msgstr "天啊，谁需要那么多蘑菇呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
