msgstr "任何有火焰的东西对我来说都是可以的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
