msgstr "也许有一天它会再长回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
