msgstr "我打赌鞍具下面肯定很臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
