msgstr "不错！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "Watch out for the business end!"
msgstr "小心它的关键部位！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "I'm tough enough to handle a little spice."
msgstr "我这么硬派，一点点辣还是受得了的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "I'm not really a bubble bath kinda gal."
msgstr "我就不是喜欢泡泡浴的那种女孩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "Dry as a bone."
msgstr "干的像一块骨头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a nice, warm spring."
msgstr "和煦，温暖的春天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "Woah, the top glassed over solid."
msgstr "哇，全都是坚硬的玻璃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "Anyone got some rolled up newspaper?"
msgstr "谁有逗狗的棍子没？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "It's covered in tooth marks."
msgstr "满是牙印。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Better safe than sorry."
msgstr "安全第一，小心没大错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Kinda feel bad for the little fella."
msgstr "小家伙真可怜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Yikes! Someone burn that thing, quick!"
msgstr "呀！来人啊，赶紧把那东西烧了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "So that's where they're comin' from."
msgstr "所以它们是从这里来的啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Sure hope no one comes back for it."
msgstr "希望不会有谁会回来找它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "This oughta give them paws pause."
msgstr "这个应该能让它们停下脚步。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT"
msgid "This was a terrible idea."
msgstr "真是一个可怕的想法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Who thought this was a good idea?"
msgstr "谁觉得这是个好主意？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "不不不。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "You wanna be my toolbox, lil guy?"
msgstr "你想当我的工具箱吗，小家伙？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Who left you out here all alone, hey?"
msgstr "谁把你一个人丢在这里了，嗯？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "Yeesh. Fishfry."
msgstr "耶，煎鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Chilly."
msgstr "好冰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Better steer clear'a that."
msgstr "最好让船离它远点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It's just a lil ice cube now."
msgstr "现在变成小冰块了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It's just a lil ice cube now."
msgstr "现在变成小冰块了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It's not factory standard."
msgstr "不符合工厂标准。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Y'gotta eat it before it melts."
msgstr "趁它化掉之前赶紧吃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "There must be a more practical solution."
msgstr "肯定有更加实际的方法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "Keep those fangs to yourself."
msgstr "别冲我龇牙咧嘴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Keeps drinks cool until breaktime."
msgstr "冰镇冷饮用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "This doesn't seem safe."
msgstr "看起来不怎么安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Winter gear, huh? Seems practical."
msgstr "冬装啊？挺实际的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can't begin to imagine how it works."
msgstr "我无法想象它的工作原理是什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "What on earth is that thing?"
msgstr "那究竟是什么东西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "Who's that good-looking gal!"
msgstr "那个漂亮的姑娘是谁呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "The sweet taste of good planning."
msgstr "精心准备的美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "I would eat them all in one sitting."
msgstr "我一口气就能全吃光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Now that's my kind of cooking."
msgstr "这才是我的烹饪风格。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "I'll try anything once."
msgstr "我什么东西都敢尝一口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "I'll stick with my bandana, thanks."
msgstr "多谢了，我还是戴我的头巾就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "Well, that's not how I would have prepared it."
msgstr "好吧，换我的话是不会这么做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "I kinda like the stuff!"
msgstr "我挺喜欢这东西的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Stay back, bug!"
msgstr "退后，虫子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "You can just calm right down."
msgstr "你现在给我冷静一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "Get out of here ya big creep."
msgstr "滚出去，你这个可怕的家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "This must be the actual key."
msgstr "肯定就是这把钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "There's gotta be something good in there."
msgstr "里面肯定有什么好东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "Incredible! Let me look at those gears!"
msgstr "太精彩了！让我看看这些装置！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "You're in rough shape, hey?"
msgstr "你的状态不怎么好，是吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Hey! You look tasty!"
msgstr "嘿！你看起来很美味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "Hey! You look tasty!"
msgstr "嘿！你看起来很美味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "Some sort of... festive devil?"
msgstr "某种……喜庆的恶魔？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "I could carry a whole warehouse in that thing!"
msgstr "那东西能装一个仓库。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "Who'd want a non-electric lamp?"
msgstr "谁想要不用电的灯？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "I love me some potatoes!"
msgstr "大爱土豆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "I could really take a hit in that thing!"
msgstr "我要是穿着那个玩意，肯定能抗重击！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
