msgstr "就是些高端装饰品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
