msgstr "看着挺郁闷的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
