msgstr "看起来有人升职了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
