msgstr "我猜在那下面会长得好一点？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Whew. That's an odor."
msgstr "呼！这味道太猛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
