msgstr "抱歉，老狗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
