msgstr "被好多玻璃挡住了，咦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
