msgstr "嘶嘶作响！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
